  "body": "Calling all developers, investors, and land-bankers! An exceptional opportunity has presented itself in the highly sought-after coastal suburb of Torbay. Our highly motivated vendor has given clear instructions: this property must be sold.\r\n\r\nConsented for 8 properties, ground work and proof-of- concept has been explored.   *\r\nThe consent outlines a premium terraced townhouse development :\r\n* 4 x Type A Units :  4 bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms, Integrated double garaging\r\n* 4 x Type B Units :  3 bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms, Integrated double garaging\r\n\r\nLocation & Lifestyle:\r\n* Situated on Glenvar Road, future residents will enjoy the ultimate North Shore lifestyle. You are just a stone's throw from the beautiful Long Bay Regional Park, Waiake Beach, Torbay village shops, and local cafes.\r\n\r\n* Families will be highly drawn to the premium educational pathway. The property is perfectly positioned in-zone for some of the area's best schools:\r\nLong Bay School (Primary)\r\nNorthcross Intermediate\r\nLong Bay College\r\n\r\nDevelopment sites of this scale and potential in this location are increasingly rare. Bring your offers. \r\n* Title - Freehold undivided half share of 8,094 sqm metres (more or less); Staged Cross Lease.  \r\nContact us today to view the plans and secure this prime piece of Torbay real estate!",
